    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:58:25Z",
      "note": "Verified source at https://basescan.org/address/0xdac30a5e2612206e2756836ed6764ec5817e6fff#code identifies direct PRXVTStaking, with immutable PRXVT token 0xc2ff2e5aa9023b1bb688178a4a547212f4614bc0. ERC20 transfers bypass updateReward; earned(account) multiplies current receipt balance by rewardPerToken minus an address-local checkpoint. The anchor trace transfers receipts to fresh helpers and pays repeated historical rewards, violating reward conservation. Standard token and routers have no separate implicated defect. Creation receipt at block 40216282 index 94 names the recorded creator; runtime is absent at 40216281 and hashes identically at deployment, 40230106 and 40234751. Source has no delegatecall, upgrade or selfdestruct path. Full 81-entry direct transaction history and all staking events show only initial reward funding before the anchor, with no causal configuration change: funding and ordinary staking determine reward exposure, while missing transfer checkpoints exist from deployment. Owner pause at 40234751 terminates claims. This runtime/campaign is distinct from Equilibria; inventory has no matching runtime or PRXVT campaign."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:58:25Z",
      "note": "Etherscan getLogs for the staking address from deployment through block 99999999 returned 20,741 unique events, retrieved with 1000-row pages and overlapping block ranges deduplicated by transaction hash/log index. Of 10,306 nonmint/nonburn receipt transfers across 270 transactions, the first is the anchor; 268 transactions belong to helper 0x702980b1ed754c214b79192a4d7c39106f19bce9 controlled by the recorded attacker. Two later transfers at blocks 45342116 and 49889673 occur after pause, with no later RewardPaid or unpause event. Source-4 groups campaign receipt, funding, disposal and pause evidence. The helper campaign emits 5,140 RewardPaid events totalling 70,522,005.880839531651768 PRXVT and corresponding burns of 7,835,778.431204392405752; six deposits total 21,260,000 and four withdrawals 6,260,000 PRXVT, including recycled rewards. Last exploit payout is 0xe534a67c5c9a334bb3d97a5caa0b8642ded229bb571bab058381b26f31f3b2e1 at block 40231644. At pause, helper and attacker retain 36,305,395.531609628682 and 255,317.095894805609459148 PRXVT; victim balance is 0.810336826718565696. Unsold tokens, burns and residual stake receive no USD value."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13T17:58:25Z",
      "note": "Three solver-mediated disposals (source-4) sell respectively 7,001,272.856256772504299534, 7,064,614.233987785357516589 and 5,298,460.675490839018137442 PRXVT. Historical call traces show native ETH payments from settlement 0x000000001ec5656dcdb24d90dfa42742738de729 to attacker of 13.369060374057417578, 10.936140010251445875 and 6.724158527253230487, totalling 31.029358911562093940 ETH. Bound deductions: original purchase input 1 ETH (greater than all 403,054.512400299519644713 purchased tokens valued at the highest disposal ratio), plus all rewards scheduled between funding timestamp 1767225397 and pause 1767258849, at the maximum 2x boost, valued at that same highest ratio. The raw scheduled rate is floor(2493690077214063547341825 / 2592000) tokens/second; upper innocent quantity is 64366.450974509917988808 PRXVT. Highest ratio is 13.369060374057417578 / 7001272.856256772504299534 ETH per PRXVT. Subtracting both from received ETH and rounding downward gives 29.906449979599384220 ETH, a conservative disposal lower bound rather than exact campaign loss. No gas, solver fee or recovery deduction is taken. Base feed 0x71041dddad3595f9ced3dccfbe3d1f4b0a16bb70 at final sale block 40231107 returns description ETH / USD, decimals 8 and latestRoundData round 18446744073709749038, answer 297323603156, updatedAt 1767251159. Sale block timestamp is 1767251561. ETH bound times $2973.23603156, rounded downward to eight USD decimals, is $88918.93465539."
